{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_08_beg","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_08","title":"渗透作战","storyCode":"OD-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"885b107b1934fa4291273b75ee797873e5828a80822644eb8afd40ed2a80994e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"灰烬按照计划来到了长泉镇矿坑，一切真相大白。疯狂科学家列维也穿越到了这个世界，与领主长子沆瀣一气，继续他的疯狂实验。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"巡林者的地图只画到这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来就只能靠我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这个洞穴......没想到这么大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这么来看，整个镇子的地下都是空的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸物没问题吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......安全屋里威力最大的那一批都在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"希望Lord的计划有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕没有那么简单，看那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......希望不是我想的那种......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畸变体感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畸变体感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"不管它是什么，它会死，就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不管出现什么鬼东西我都不会觉得奇怪了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不要缠斗，尽量突破，我们没有时间浪费在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么长泉的地下会有一个这样的设施？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"科恩......这里是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道！我*粗口*就知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"原来大部分实验室都被传送到这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"现在想想，都是我们太大意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"在这个镇子上生活了这么久，竟然毫无察觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事情的背后，就是那个疯子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"还能是什么，死亡的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"保持警惕，跟紧点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"笼子？这么多笼子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"全都是尸体......人和动物混在一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是列维•克里奇科的杰作，此人的疯狂和残忍超乎常人想象。怪我当初还想过活捉，就应该一枪打穿他的脑门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"一般的疯子还做不到这么恐怖的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......笼子里有个活人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看谁来了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"是那个德鲁奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"这混账东西就是烧成灰我也认得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是你们，是那群雇佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很高兴看到你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我们之前有过很多矛盾......但是这些矛盾都可以搁置一边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜你们要找那个学者......我知道他在哪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在有一个共同的敌人，在这件事上我们应该能够合作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"这人的脸皮厚得让我感到恶心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边那个菲林，我知道你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身手还是很好认的，哥伦比亚的雇佣兵市场上能打听到很多消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是个杀手，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛愿意雇佣你，说明即便是罗德岛也有很多脏活要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起其他人，你一定更懂得权衡利弊，我们来谈谈吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......闭嘴，或者我让你闭嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是遗憾，我以为像你这样的人会更加务实。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"把笼子打开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，把笼子打开就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就对了，大家都是明白人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我当然是个明白人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你要做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你！你疯了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命......救......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别......别打了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你还能说话，说明打得还不够。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一拳，是为了米亚罗医生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，别打了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"你下手也太狠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么......你还同情他?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"好家伙，你都快把他打死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"脸都打变形了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"省点力气吧，我们还有事要干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得对。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是感觉心情舒畅了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我也舒畅多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙被关在这里，看起来也是被列维算计了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我一点都不觉得惊讶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lab"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......没看到有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......谨慎一点，可能会有埋伏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧是谁来了，我的实验宝地又有访客了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许久不见，彩虹小队的朋友们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大实验场地的一角亮起了灯光——这个角落此前没被昏暗照明覆盖，同时，所有人也理解了之前没有感知到气息传来的原因。\n年迈的学者站在一道厚重的玻璃墙面后，而在他后方不远处，则又伫立着一座巨大的培养仓。列维脸上散发着极不自然又令人胆寒的怪诞笑容。\n片刻之后，培养仓内的灯光也亮了起来，一大块被结缔组织包裹的球形晶体漂浮在内，它蠕动着，它抽搐着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们来得正是时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......你们每次来得都正是时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要费劲了，这面玻璃是防弹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对你的果断表示赞许，板机扣得毫不犹豫，不等人体面地结束开场白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但让我们回到这场戏来吧，美好的开场需要优秀的观众，美好的开场也需要完整的开幕致辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是赞颂造物主伟业的日子，而这个造物主，就是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"造物主？你还真敢给自己的脸上贴金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个丧心病狂的疯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疯子......呵。庸人最喜欢用这个词来形容他们不能理解的思维和想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这个世界，看看这个世界！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"截然不同的化学性质......完全颠覆的物理法则......科学之花要在探索和怀疑中绽放，这个充满未知的大地就是最好的土壤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在，我成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们看到了吗？你们感到了吗？就在那乍看极为类似的表象之下，万事万物运作的原理全然不同！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是生命的进化，这是存在的迭代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石就是这个世界的真理，你们应当接纳它，而不是恐惧它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎来到未来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你对自己的所作所为就没有一丝道德上的抵触吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"人命在你看来究竟是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人性本质软弱，善恶是软弱前提下的主观定义，老生常谈的愧疚感则不过是我们大脑产生的无数种认知信号之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我所追求的科学，从来不会被这种软弱与模糊的概念所左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要自欺欺人了，即便是在这个世界，你依然尝试用你那种毫无意义的概念来束缚自己的思维。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是电子信息技术，核能源......这些技术最初的来源都是为了彼此更高效地互相杀戮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你还想给科学添加一层新的定义？让一切都符合你稚嫩的精神需求？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚昧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我原谅你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们可以不明白，我允许你们不明白。思维滞后是一种普遍存在的愚昧，这不是你们的错，我原谅你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的致辞结束了，除了原谅，我还要感谢诸位的耐心等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，赞美吧——赞美这种全新的生命形态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列维","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赞美——赞美——赞美！！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_12"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鲜血四溅，光滑的无机物挤破了培养皿，蠕动的畸形肢体以不可思议的角度支撑着那不协调的巨大球状头部，尖锐殷红的骨刺直直戳穿了科学家的颅骨。挤压、变形， 而后融为一体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论付出什么代价，绝不能让这个东西到地面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们拖住它！我安装炸弹！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["灰烬"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["闪击"]}]}
